---
import AdminLayout from '~/layouts/AdminLayout.astro';
---

<AdminLayout title="Admin Dashboard">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16">
    <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Admin Dashboard</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-slate-600">
      Компактный операторский обзор runtime и lead pipeline. Используйте admin token или allowlisted IP.
    </p>

    <div
      class="mb-6 grid gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#e8d8cb] bg-[#f9f4ef] p-4 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-end"
    >
      <label class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">
        Admin token (Bearer)
        <input
          id="admin-token"
          name="admin-token"
          type="password"
          autocomplete="off"
          placeholder="METRICS_ADMIN_TOKEN"
          class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-[#d9c6b7] px-3 py-2"
        />
      </label>
      <button
        id="admin-token-clear"
        type="button"
        class="inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-md border border-[#d9c6b7] bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-[#f3ebe4]"
      >
        Очистить токен
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[280px_1fr]">
      <a
        href="/admin/metrics"
        class="ui-btn-state block rounded-2xl border border-[#e8d8cb] bg-white p-5 hover:bg-[#f9f4ef]"
      >
        <h2 class="mb-1 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Lead Metrics</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Funnel-метрики и детализация по страницам.</p>
      </a>

      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e8d8cb] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h2 class="mb-1 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">System Status</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Traffic-light health panel с latency, freshness и short reasons.</p>
          </div>
          <span
            id="health-overall-chip"
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-700"
          >
            Idle
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <button
            id="health-check-button"
            type="button"
            class="inline-flex w-fit items-center rounded-md bg-[#8b5a3c] px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#7f5438]"
          >
            Refresh now
          </button>
          <label class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">
            <input id="health-auto-refresh" type="checkbox" class="h-4 w-4 rounded border-[#d9c6b7]" />
            Auto refresh
          </label>
          <label class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">
            Interval
            <select
              id="health-refresh-interval"
              class="ml-2 rounded-md border border-[#d9c6b7] bg-white px-2 py-1 text-sm text-slate-700"
            >
              <option value="5000">5s</option>
              <option value="15000">15s</option>
              <option value="30000">30s</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>

        <div
          id="health-status"
          data-state="idle"
          class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-[#e8d8cb] bg-[#f9f4ef] px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-700"
        >
          Введите admin token или используйте allowlisted IP, затем нажмите «Refresh now».
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div id="health-dashboard" class="mt-4 grid gap-4" hidden>
      <div class="grid gap-4 xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.35fr)_minmax(320px,0.95fr)]">
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e8d8cb] bg-white p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Traffic Lights</h3>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400">Health panel</span>
          </div>
          <div id="health-cards" class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"></div>
        </section>

        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e8d8cb] bg-white p-5">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Performance</h3>
          <dl class="mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[150px_1fr] gap-3">
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Auth method</dt><dd
                id="health-auth-method"
                class="font-semibold text-slate-900"
              >
                -
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[150px_1fr] gap-3">
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Last updated</dt><dd
                id="health-last-updated"
                class="font-semibold text-slate-900"
              >
                -
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[150px_1fr] gap-3">
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Check duration</dt><dd
                id="health-total-duration"
                class="font-semibold text-slate-900"
              >
                -
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[150px_1fr] gap-3">
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Average check</dt><dd
                id="health-average-latency"
                class="font-semibold text-slate-900"
              >
                -
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[150px_1fr] gap-3">
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Slowest check</dt><dd id="health-latency" class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
                -
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[150px_1fr] gap-3">
              <dt class="text-slate-500">System auth</dt><dd
                id="health-system-auth"
                class="font-semibold text-slate-900"
              >
                -
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[150px_1fr] gap-3">
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Proxy trust</dt><dd
                id="health-proxy-trust"
                class="font-semibold text-slate-900"
              >
                -
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[150px_1fr] gap-3">
              <dt class="text-slate-500">Fail-open</dt><dd id="health-fail-open" class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
                -
              </dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </section>
      </div>

      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e8d8cb] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Operations</h3>
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400">Quick view</span>
        </div>
        <div id="health-operations" class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4"></div>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e8d8cb] bg-white p-5">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Detailed checks</h3>
          <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-400">Latency and notes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-[#e8d8cb]">
          <table class="w-full min-w-[720px] text-sm">
            <thead class="bg-[#f9f4ef] text-left text-slate-600">
              <tr>
                <th class="px-4 py-3">Check</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-3">Status</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-3">Latency</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-3">Checked</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-3">Notes</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="health-detail-body" class="bg-white"></tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <details class="rounded-2xl border border-[#e8d8cb] bg-white p-5">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">Show raw health JSON</summary>
        <pre
          id="health-raw"
          class="mt-4 max-h-96 overflow-auto rounded-xl border border-[#e8d8cb] bg-[#f9f4ef] p-3 text-xs text-slate-700">-</pre>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script src="/scripts/admin-health.js" defer></script>
</AdminLayout>

